## How to Run It

```bash
# Install
pip install -e .

# Run the validator on the built-in sample deed (no API key needed)
python -m deed_validator

# Run all 114 tests
pytest -v

# Start the web UI (optional)
pip install -e ".[web]"
python -m deed_validator.server
```

No API key required for demo or tests. The system falls back to a static fixture that mirrors LLM output.

